# Default proxy image: send only declared Rust build inputs to the builder.
# In particular, local state, keys, .agents, .git, target and caches stay local.
**
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!build.rs
!LICENSE
!README.md
!src/
!src/**/
!src/**/*.rs
!src/manage/acme/staging-roots.pem
!src/manage/contract/*.json
